{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49330","headline":"河传 一 · 韦庄","name":"河传 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处，烟雨。\n隋堤春暮，柳色葱茏。\n画桡金缕，翠旗高颭香风，水光融。\n青娥殿脚春妆媚，轻云里，绰约司花妓。\n江都宫阙，清淮月映迷楼，古今愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}